able and cannot be exchanged for cash.<br><b>6.&nbsp;General Conditions:</b> a. Canadian Protein reserves the right to disqualify any entry that violates the entry guidelines or terms. b. By participating in the Contest, entrants agree to abide by these terms and the decisions of Canadian Protein, which are final and binding. c. Canadian Protein reserves the right to cancel or modify the Contest if fraud, technical failures, or any other factor beyond its control impairs the integrity of the Contest.<br><b>7.&nbsp;Privacy:</b> a. Personal information collected during the Contest will be used in accordance with Canadian Protein's privacy policy.<br><b>8.&nbsp;Governing Law:</b> a. The Contest is governed by the laws of Canada without regard to conflicts of law principles.\n<br><b>9.&nbsp;Sponsor:</b> a. The Contest is sponsored by Canadian Protein, [2835 Kew Dr Unit #6, Windsor, ON N8T 3B7].<br><br>By participating in the <span style=\"color: rgb(255, 29, 90);\">#PROTEINVIBES</span> TikTok Contest, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to abide by these Terms of Service. Good luck!"
